# Web Preview (example tile): English strings.

tile-name = Web Preview (example)
tile-description = Shows the web app you're building, such as localhost:5173, in a browser window next to your panes, and lists the pages you opened recently.
setting-address = Ports on localhost to open, separated by commas: each opens localhost:PORT in a page of its own (5173, 3000). Full addresses such as staging.example.com work too.
setting-docked = Show beside the panes (off: in a window of its own)
setting-panel = Show recent pages beside the panes
cmd-open = Web Preview: Open
cmd-move = Web Preview: Beside the panes or in a window
cmd-reload = Web Preview: Reload
cmd-back = Web Preview: Back
cmd-forward = Web Preview: Forward
cmd-close = Web Preview: Close
cmd-clear = Web Preview: Forget recent pages
panel-title = Web Preview
panel-subtitle = Recent pages
recent-cleared = Recent pages forgotten.
error-no-browser = This Tilefold can't open a browser for tiles yet. Update Tilefold to use Web Preview.
error-refused = Web Preview couldn't open that: { $reason }
error-failed = Something went wrong with the preview window. Try again.
error-one-page = This Tilefold shows one page at a time, so Web Preview opened only the first address. Update Tilefold to open them all.
